3. Branching & Collaboration
What is branching?
Branching allows developers to work independently without affecting main code.
Bash
git branch feature1
git checkout feature1
What is merge conflict?
Occurs when two users modify the same file and Git cannot merge automatically.
What is Pull Request (PR)?
A pull request is used to request code review before merging changes.
Difference between Fork and Clone?
Fork → Copy repo to own GitHub account
Clone → Copy repo to local system
Merge vs Rebase
Merge preserves history
Rebase creates clean linear history
